[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Queen's Gambit Declined"]
[Variation "Early ...dxc4 and ...b5"]
[ECO "D50"]
[Character "tactical"]
[Risk "medium"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "pawn-grab"]
[Themes "pawn-grab,tempo"]
[Kind "against-us"]

1. d4 d5 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Bg5 Nbd7 5. e3 dxc4?! { Takes the pawn at once. White's bishop reaches c4 in one move,
and Black has nothing to show for the lost tempo. } 6. Bxc4 b5? { Tries to keep the extra pawn, but there is no
extra pawn: the bishop on c4 now has a free capture. } 7. Bxb5 { White is a clean pawn up. Wait for Bd3 before
...dxc4, then free the position with ...c5 or ...e5. } *
